Dear Valued Customer, We hope this message finds you well. At SecureTech, your security and privacy are our top priorities. We are reaching out to inform you about some important updates to your account security features that will take effect on November 15, 2023. **Enhanced Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)** To further protect your account, we are introducing an enhanced version of our Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) process. This update will provide an additional layer of security by requiring not only your password but also a one-time code sent to your registered mobile device each time you log in from an unrecognized device. To set this up, please log in to your account and follow the prompts under the ""Security Settings"" section. **New Security Alerts** We are also implementing new security alerts that will notify you of any suspicious activity on your account. You will receive real-time alerts via email and SMS for actions such as password changes, new device logins, and unusual account access patterns. This feature is designed to keep you informed and allow you to take immediate action if you suspect any unauthorized access. **Regular Account Review** As part of our commitment to your security, we encourage you to review your account settings regularly. Please ensure that your recovery email and phone number are up to date, and consider changing your password periodically to maintain optimal security. **Customer Support**